From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
Date: Fri, 26 May 2023 15:27:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] MdeModulePkg/DisplayEngineDxe: Change the delimiter for
 ONE_OF

[ouroBIOS: commit b795f86961f3 of MrChromebox's edk2, as it is]

The delimiters for ONE_OF are `<` and `>`, which doesn't match
the other definitions. Change these to `[` and `]` so it's
uniform.

Signed-off-by: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
---
 MdeModulePkg/Universal/DisplayEngineDxe/FormDisplay.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/MdeModulePkg/Universal/DisplayEngineDxe/FormDisplay.h b/MdeModulePkg/Universal/DisplayEngineDxe/FormDisplay.h
index 34e6cc53c67fabeb5211f7e680056a49180d384c..5cddaffffa337c5f1b6d77a4c17fda5b72ed23f9 100644
--- a/MdeModulePkg/Universal/DisplayEngineDxe/FormDisplay.h
+++ b/MdeModulePkg/Universal/DisplayEngineDxe/FormDisplay.h
@@ -84,8 +84,8 @@ extern BOOLEAN  gMisMatch;
 //
 // Display definitions
 //
-#define LEFT_ONEOF_DELIMITER   L'<'
-#define RIGHT_ONEOF_DELIMITER  L'>'
+#define LEFT_ONEOF_DELIMITER   L'['
+#define RIGHT_ONEOF_DELIMITER  L']'
 
 #define LEFT_NUMERIC_DELIMITER   L'['
 #define RIGHT_NUMERIC_DELIMITER  L']'
